["coding goal","coding goal"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A blog post","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Why I Decided to Learn to Code","paras":["Last year I **decided to learn** coding. I **wanted to build** my own site, so I **chose to study** every night. At first I **failed to keep up with** the lessons, but I **learned to ask** for help.","Now I **hope to find** a job in tech. If you **plan to start**, don’t be afraid to **keep up with** the news."],"kicker":"BLOG","by":"Gabi, student","gloss":[]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Gabi decided to learn to code last year.","ans":"T","why":"Last year."},{"q":"Gabi found it easy at first.","ans":"F","why":"failed to keep up."},{"q":"Gabi hopes to find a job in tech.","ans":"T","why":"hope to find a job."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“keep up with” = ?","opts":["acompanhar","manter acima","guardar com"],"ans":0,"why":"keep up with."},{"q":"“site” = ?","opts":["site","sítio só","sinal"],"ans":0,"why":"site."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"verbo + to: uso","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Verbo","Exemplo"],"rows":[["decide to","**I decided to learn.**"],["want to","**I wanted to build a site.**"],["choose to","**I chose to study at night.**"],["fail to","**I failed to keep up.**"],["learn to","**I learned to ask.**"]],"cap":"verbo + to: uso"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"**keep up with** = acompanhar o ritmo. Phrasal verb **inseparável**."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"I decided ___ learn coding. (to)","a":"to","why":"decide to."},{"s":"I wanted ___ build a site. (to)","a":"to","why":"want to."},{"s":"I failed to keep ___ with the lessons. (up)","a":"up","why":"keep up with."},{"s":"I hope ___ find a job. (to)","a":"to","why":"hope to."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["coding journey","jornada de programação"],["night study","estudo noturno"],["personal site","site pessoal"],["web page","página web"],["code lesson","aula de código"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["site","I","wanted","to","build","my","own"],"ans":"I wanted to build my own site","pt":"Queria construir meu site."},{"words":["did","you","decide","to","learn","coding","Why"],"ans":"Why did you decide to learn coding","pt":"Por que decidiu aprender a programar?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"coding journey","pos":"word","pt":"jornada de programação","ex":"Coding journey.","expt":"Jornada de programação."},{"w":"personal site","pos":"word","pt":"site pessoal","ex":"Personal site.","expt":"Site pessoal."},{"w":"web page","pos":"word","pt":"página web","ex":"Web page.","expt":"Página web."},{"w":"code lesson","pos":"word","pt":"aula de código","ex":"Code lesson.","expt":"Aula de código."},{"w":"tech news","pos":"word","pt":"notícias de tecnologia","ex":"Tech news.","expt":"Notícias de tecnologia."},{"w":"online mentor","pos":"word","pt":"mentor online","ex":"Online mentor.","expt":"Mentor online."},{"w":"tech job","pos":"word","pt":"emprego em tecnologia","ex":"Tech job.","expt":"Emprego em tecnologia."},{"w":"beginner project","pos":"word","pt":"projeto para iniciantes","ex":"Beginner project.","expt":"Projeto para iniciantes."},{"w":"coding diary","pos":"word","pt":"diário de programação","ex":"Coding diary.","expt":"Diário de programação."},{"w":"practice site","pos":"word","pt":"site de prática","ex":"Practice site.","expt":"Site de prática."},{"w":"home page","pos":"word","pt":"página inicial","ex":"Home page.","expt":"Página inicial."},{"w":"code error","pos":"word","pt":"erro de código","ex":"Code error.","expt":"Erro de código."},{"w":"late-night coding","pos":"word","pt":"programar de madrugada","ex":"Late-night coding.","expt":"Programar de madrugada."},{"w":"forum answer","pos":"word","pt":"resposta de fórum","ex":"Forum answer.","expt":"Resposta de fórum."},{"w":"hard lesson","pos":"word","pt":"lição difícil","ex":"Hard lesson.","expt":"Lição difícil."},{"w":"tutorial video","pos":"word","pt":"vídeo tutorial","ex":"Tutorial video.","expt":"Vídeo tutorial."},{"w":"dev community","pos":"word","pt":"comunidade de desenvolvedores","ex":"Dev community.","expt":"Comunidade de desenvolvedores."},{"w":"coding goal","pos":"word","pt":"coding goal","ex":"meta de programação","expt":"Coding goal."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**Better late than never.** — Antes tarde do que nunca.","**Slowly but surely.** — Devagar, mas com segurança.","**Small steps count.** — Pequenos passos contam.","**Why did you decide to learn coding?** — Por que decidiu aprender a programar?","**I wanted to build my own site.** — Queria construir meu site.","**Was it hard to keep up with the lessons?** — Foi difícil acompanhar as aulas?","**Ins and outs.** — Detalhes.","**Know the drill.** — Saber como funciona."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"learn","pt":"aprender","forms":[["I / you / we / they learn","I learn fast."],["he / she / it learns","Aprendo rápido."]]}]},{"type":"table","head":["Phrasal verb","Significado","Exemplo"],"rows":[["**keep up with**","acompanhar","Keep up with the class. — Acompanhe a turma."]],"cap":"Phrasal verbs"}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Study blog","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Study blog","lines":[["Ana","Why did you decide to learn coding?","Por que decidiu aprender a programar?"],["Gabi","I wanted to build my own site.","Queria construir meu site."],["Ana","Was it hard to keep up with the lessons?","Foi difícil acompanhar as aulas?"],["Gabi","At first, yes. I learned to ask for help.","No começo, sim. Aprendi a pedir ajuda."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Word stress","items":[{"labe